HB0191 Civil penalties for cannabis.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Provenza and Singh and Senator(s)
Case and Rothfuss
AN ACT relating to food and drugs; creating a civil penalty for offenses related
to specified amounts of marijuana and amending related criminal penalties as
specified; eliminating use of marijuana and possession of marijuana
paraphernalia as crimes; amending the prohibition on practitioners prescribing
marijuana; amending definitions; making conforming amendments; repealing a
provision; requiring rulemaking; and providing for effective dates.
